orge D. Schindler","x":"As with other regions, the slowing macroeconomic environment is leading to more client opportunities for the cost savings associated with managed IT services.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/06/cgi-group-inc-gib-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"GIB 2019 Q4","e":"gib","d":"2019-11-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"George D. Schindler","x":"At the same time a slowing growth economy and geopolitical uncertainties are causing many of our clients to also place a growing premium on using technology to generate cost savings and efficiencies.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/06/cgi-group-inc-gib-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"GIB 2020 Q1","e":"gib","d":"2020-01-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Francois Boulanger","x":"When excluding the impact on non-deductible restructuring expenses, our effective tax rate was 25.1%, within the expected range of 24.5% to 26.5%.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/01/29/cgi-group-inc-gib-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"GIB 2020 Q1","e":"gib","d":"2020-01-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"George D. Schindler","x":"EBIT margin was 7.8%, which we expect to continue improving throughout the year, as further benefits from the Acando integration and the restructuring of the infrastructure business in Sweden, are each fully realized.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/01/29/cgi-group-inc-gib-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"GIB 2020 Q2","e":"gib","d":"2020-04-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"George D. Schindler","x":"As part of our crisis response, we have instituted cost reduction and avoidance efforts to protect our margin.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/29/cgi-group-inc-gib-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"GIB 2020 Q2","e":"gib","d":"2020-04-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"George D. Schindler","x":"For now, we estimate that these permanent restructuring actions will result in a cost between $40 million and $75 million, which we would plan to expense over the next couple of quarters.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/29/cgi-group-inc-gib-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"GIB 2020 Q3","e":"gib","d":"2020-07-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Maher Yaghi","x":"And how fast should we expect those restructurings to pass through your P&L?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/30/cgi-group-inc-gib-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"GIB 2020 Q3","e":"gib","d":"2020-07-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Francois Boulanger","x":"Our effective tax rate in Q3 was 27% or 26.1%, when excluding non-deductible restructuring expenses.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/30/cgi-group-inc-gib-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"GIB 2020 Q3","e":"gib","d":"2020-07-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Francois Boulanger","x":"Integration costs related mainly to recent acquisitions totaled CAD20 million in Q3 and we also incurred restructuring expenses of CAD39.5 million in the quarter, initiating the actions in response to the pandemic we outlined in Q2.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/30/cgi-group-inc-gib-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"GIB 2020 Q4","e":"gib","d":"2020-11-11","l":"theater","r":"analyst","s":"Deepak Kaushal","x":"What are the activities for you guys, in terms of local business there and local delivery in that theater?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/11/cgi-group-inc-gib-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"GIB 2020 Q4","e":"gib","d":"2020-11-11","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Francois Boulanger","x":"The year-over-year increase was mainly the results of lower SG&A discretionary expenses, synergies in our infrastructure business, savings from our restructuring plan, and CAD8.5 million related to IFRS-16.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/11/cgi-group-inc-gib-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"GIB 2020 Q4","e":"gib","d":"2020-11-11","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Francois Boulanger","x":"Restructuring expenses were CAD84 million in the quarter, as a result of actions taken in response to the pandemic, as we outlined in Q2.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/11/cgi-group-inc-gib-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"GIB 2021 Q1","e":"gib","d":"2021-01-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Francois Boulanger","x":"The year-over-year increase was mainly the result of savings from our restructuring plan, lower discretionary expenses, and the benefit of synergies achieved through the integration of prior years acquisitions.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/01/27/cgi-group-inc-gib-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"GIB 2021 Q1","e":"gib","d":"2021-01-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Francois Boulanger","x":"As highlighted last quarter, our restructuring costs including actions taken in response to the pandemic total CAD155 million and were completed during our fiscal year ended September 30, 2020.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/01/27/cgi-group-inc-gib-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"GIB 2021 Q2","e":"gib","d":"2021-04-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"George D. Schindler","x":"Through our consulting and systems integration services, we will help streamline and support the client's cloud-based data management platforms, an expansion and extension of our Trade360 IP engagement with one of Canada's top multinational banks.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/28/cgi-group-inc-gib-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"GIB 2021 Q2","e":"gib","d":"2021-04-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"George D. Schindler","x":"On this managed services engagement, we will collaborate with their insurance business to deliver advanced analytics and automation to support and enhance customer and employee experience as well as generate cost savings.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/28/cgi-group-inc-gib-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"GIB 2021 Q3","e":"gib","d":"2021-07-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Francois Boulanger","x":"This improvement was mainly due to a higher EBIT and lower restructuring costs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/28/cgi-inc-gib-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"GIB 2021 Q3","e":"gib","d":"2021-07-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Francois Boulanger","x":"Including integration and restructuring costs, net earnings were $339 million for a margin of 11.2% and diluted earnings per share were $1.36, an accretion of 15.3% when compared to $1.18 in the same quarter last year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/28/cgi-inc-gib-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"GIB 2021 Q4","e":"gib","d":"2021-11-10","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Thanos Moschopoulos","x":"I'll pass it on.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/10/cgi-inc-gib-q4-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"GIB 2021 Q4","e":"gib","d":"2021-11-10","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Francois Boulanger","x":"This improvement was mainly due to revenue growth, margin improvement and lower restructuring costs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/10/cgi-inc-gib-q4-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"GIB 2021 Q4","e":"gib","d":"2021-11-10","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Francois Boulanger","x":"Excluding integration and restructuring costs, net earnings were CAD347 million for a margin of 11.5%, and diluted earnings per share were CAD1.40, an accretion of 14.8% when compared to CAD1.22 in the same quarter last year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/10/cgi-inc-gib-q4-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"GIB 2026 Q3","e":"gib","d":"2026-07-29","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Steve Perron","x":"In Q3, we continued to deploy our capital and invested $105 million back into our business, which includes strategic investments in advanced AI, $50 million for business acquisitions, $413 million to buy back our stock.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/07/cgi-gib-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"GIB 2026 Q3","e":"gib","d":"2026-07-29","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Timothy Hurlebaus","x":"These investments help clients adopt AI, while maintaining control over sensitive data and addressing both regulatory compliance and national security requirements.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/07/cgi-gib-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"GIB 2026 Q3","e":"gib","d":"2026-07-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Suthan Sukumar","x":"Is that more a function of pricing power or growing scope?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/07/cgi-gib-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"GIB 2026 Q3","e":"gib","d":"2026-07-29","l":"ai_disruption","r":"analyst","s":"Thanos Moschopoulos","x":"Tim, can you give us an update on M&A, just given all the disruption with AI valuations in the market and so forth.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/07/cgi-gib-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"GIB 2026 Q4","e":"gib","d":"2026-11-11","l":"ai_spend","r":"analyst","s":"Jason Dee","x":"In Q4, we continued to deploy our capital and invested $89 million back into our business, which includes strategic investments in advanced AI $35 million for business acquisitions, $336 million in net debt repayment, $167 million to buy back our stock.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/11/cgi-gib-q4-2026-earnings-call-t